\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  Jesus, our King, may we be victorious!
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj See how the thick darkness surround us all.
\par And Satan's forces of wicked intentions
\par Persistently rise to cause destruction
\par Satan doth use all resources for tempting
\par Only to trap and so have me to destroy.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  Jesus, help us to overcome the Devil,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Because you have rescued us from his grips,
\par And from the world, from the lusts of the body.
\par My greatest worries have roots in his wits,
\par Therefore if Babel should rise up against me,
\par Jesus my Lord, rise and come to my defence.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  Jesus, make me victorious for the fact that,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj  My troubles are nakedly known to Thee,
\par Come, should the sins of my youth give me problems
\par I am rebuked by my conscience each day.
\par Lord, may I feel the impact of redemption,
\par So that I shall be submissive unto Thee.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  Jesus, make me victorious for if my sins,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj My pride, my arrogance and deep hatred,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 And useless lust should all just be exposed now,
\par So that You should know the state of my life,
\par Great shall my shame and disgrace be that moment,
\par And by Your death I am greatly put to shame.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.    Jesus, make me victorious so that You may
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Imprison the desires of my flesh,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Then, all the desires of my heart and love,
\par Shall climb up unto the heaven above.
\par And project me into Your Godly nature.
\par For the well-being of my Sprit and my soul.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

